    "title": "Lawrence Announces Significant State Funding for Southern Chester County Infrastructure",
    "url": "http://www.replawrence.com/News/38739/Press-Releases/Lawrence-Announces-Significant-State-Funding-for-Southern-Chester-County-Infrastructure",
